      "widgets_values": [
        "32x32 canvas: the video is a throwaway, the AUDIO is the product.\nWire length from H3AudioPrompt -> it snaps to the 17n+5 grid.\n\nTWO SPEAKERS\n  script:  S1: first line\n           0:05 | S2: second line\n  voice:   S1 = a raw raised female voice\n           S2 = a flat tired male voice\n  voices_from_audio: S1,S2   (maps to ref_audio_1 / ref_audio_2 IN ORDER)\n\nSet voices_from_audio to 'none' and the voices come from the descriptions\ninstead - then both LoadAudio nodes can be deleted or bypassed.\nMixing works too: 'S1' clones S1 and leaves S2 described.\n\nUse CLEAN 5-10s samples. A long reference crowds out the target:\na 20s sample encodes to ~830 audio latent frames, about the size of a\n20s generation, so it competes token-for-token."
      ]
    },
